":"புகழ்","tr":"pukaḻ"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"மா","tr":"mā"}]},{"text":"யலவே","tr":"yalavē","foot":"puḷimā","acai":[{"kind":"nirai","text":"யல","tr":"yala"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"வே","tr":"vē"}]}]]},"ai":{"lines":[{"words":[{"surface":"எரிபுனக்","parts":[{"text":"எரிபுனக்","lemma":"எரிபுனக்","gloss":"burnt upland field"}],"gloss":"burnt upland field","split_unverified":true},{"surface":"குறவன்","parts":[{"text":"குறவன்","lemma":"kuṟavaṉ","gloss":"hillman"}],"gloss":"hillman"},{"surface":"குறையல்","parts":[{"text":"குறையல்","lemma":"kuṟaiyal","gloss":"cut log"}],"gloss":"cut log"},{"surface":"அன்ன","parts":[{"text":"அன்ன","lemma":"aṉṉa","gloss":"like"}],"gloss":"like"}]},{"words":[{"surface":"கரிபுற","parts":[{"text":"கரிபுற","lemma":"கரிபுற","gloss":"charred back"}],"gloss":"charred back","split_unverified":true},{"surface":"விறகின்","parts":[{"text":"விறகு","lemma":"viṟaku","gloss":"firewood"},{"text":"இன்","lemma":"iṉ","gloss":"of"}],"gloss":"of firewood"},{"surface":"ஈம","parts":[{"text":"ஈம","lemma":"ஈம","gloss":"funeral pyre"}],"gloss":"funeral pyre","split_unverified":true},{"surface":"ஒள்அழல்","parts":[{"text":"ஒள்","lemma":"oḷ","gloss":"bright"},{"text":"அழல்","lemma":"azhal","gloss":"fire"}],"gloss":"bright fire"}]},{"words":[{"surface":"குருகினும்","parts":[{"text":"குருகு","lemma":"kuruku","gloss":"heron"},{"text":"இனும்","lemma":"iṉum","gloss":"even than"}],"gloss":"even than a heron"},{"surface":"குறுகுக","parts":[{"text":"குறுகு","lemma":"kuṟuku","gloss":"shrink"},{"text":"க","lemma":"ka","gloss":"let it"}],"gloss":"let it shrink"},{"surface":"குறுகாது","parts":[{"text":"குறுகு","lemma":"kuṟuku","gloss":"shrink"},{"text":"ஆது","lemma":"ātu","gloss":"without"}],"gloss":"without shrinking"},{"surface":"சென்று","parts":[{"text":"சென்று","lemma":"சென்று","gloss":"having gone"}],"gloss":"having gone","split_unverified":true}]},{"words":[{"surface":"விசும்பஉற","parts":[{"text":"விசும்பஉற","lemma":"விசும்பஉற","gloss":"reaching the sky"}],"gloss":"reaching the sky","split_unverified":true},{"surface":"நீளினும்","parts":[{"text":"நீள்","lemma":"nīḷ","gloss":"lengthen"},{"text":"இனும்","lemma":"iṉum","gloss":"even if"}],"gloss":"even if it lengthens"},{"surface":"நீள்க","parts":[{"text":"நீள்","lemma":"nīḷ","gloss":"lengthen"},{"text":"க","lemma":"ka","gloss":"let it"}],"gloss":"let it lengthen"},{"surface":"பசுங்கதிர்","parts":[{"text":"பசுமை","lemma":"pacumai","gloss":"cool"},{"text":"கதிர்","lemma":"katir","gloss":"ray"}],"gloss":"cool rays"}]},{"words":[{"surface":"திங்கள்","parts":[{"text":"திங்கள்","lemma":"tiṅkaḷ","gloss":"moon"}],"gloss":"moon"},{"surface":"அன்ன","parts":[{"text":"அன்ன","lemma":"aṉṉa","gloss":"like"}],"gloss":"like"},{"surface":"வெண்குடை","parts":[{"text":"வெண்மை","lemma":"veṇmai","gloss":"white"},{"text":"குடை","lemma":"kuṭai","gloss":"umbrella"}],"gloss":"white umbrella"}]},{"words":[{"surface":"ஒண்ஞாயிறு","parts":[{"text":"ஒண்ஞாயிறு","lemma":"ஒண்ஞாயிறு","gloss":"bright sun"}],"gloss":"bright sun","split_unverified":true},{"surface":"அன்னோன்","parts":[{"text":"அன்னோன்","lemma":"aṉṉōṉ","gloss":"he who is like"}],"gloss":"he who is like"},{"surface":"புகழ்","parts":[{"text":"புகழ்","lemma":"pukaḻ","gloss":"fame"}],"gloss":"fame"},{"surface":"மாயலவே","parts":[{"text":"மாய்","lemma":"māy","gloss":"perish"},{"text":"அல","lemma":"ala","gloss":"will not"},{"text":"ஏ","lemma":"ē","gloss":"indeed"}],"gloss":"will indeed not perish"}]}],"literal":"Like the cut logs of a hillman in a burnt forest clearing, / the bright flame of the funeral pyre of firewood with charred backs, / let it shrink even smaller than a heron, or without shrinking, going / to reach the sky, even if it rises high, let it rise high! / He who had a white umbrella like the cool-rayed moon, / and who was like the bright sun—his fame will never perish!","translation":"Like the logs cut by a hillman in a burnt forest clearing, the bright flame of the funeral pyre rises from firewood with charred backs. Let that flame shrink to be smaller than a heron, or let it stretch without shrinking, rising high to touch the sky! The fame of him who possessed a white umbrella like the cool-rayed moon, and who was like the bright sun, will never perish!","modern":"எரிக்கப்பட்ட காட்டுப் புலத்தில் குறவன் வெட்டிய மரத்துண்டுகளைப் போல, கரி படிந்த புறத்தைக் கொண்ட விறகுகளால் எரியும் ஈமத்தின் ஒளிரும் நெருப்பே! நீ குருகை விடவும் சிறிதாகச் சுருங்கிப் போனாலும் போகுக! அல்லது சுருங்காமல் மேலே சென்று வானத்தைத் தொடுமளவிற்கு உயர்ந்து நீண்டாலும் நீளுக! குளிர்ந்த கதிர்களை உடைய திங்களைப் போன்ற வெண்கொற்றக் குடையையும், ஒளிரும் ஞாயிற்றைப் போன்ற ஆற்றலையும் உடைய அவனது புகழ் என்றும் அழியாது!","explanation":"This poem is a moving lament (kaiyaṟunilai) by the famous poet Avvaiyar on the death of her patron, the chieftain Adhiyaman Neduman Anji. Standing before his funeral pyre, she addresses the bright flame consuming his body. She compares the firewood of the pyre, with its charred backs, to the logs cut by a hillman in a slash-and-burn forest clearing. Avvaiyar defiantly tells the fire that it may shrink to be smaller than a heron or leap up high to touch the sky; it makes no difference because the fire can only consume his physical body. The fame of Adhiyaman, who ruled with a cool, moon-like white umbrella of justice and shone like the bright sun in battle, is immortal and will never perish.","model":"gemini-3.5-flash"},"timing":{"male":[[0.0,0.35],[0.7,1.1],[1.1,1.3],[1.3,1.5],[1.5,2.4],[2.4,2.8],[2.8,3.06],[3.06,3.7],[3.7,4.39],[4.39,5.3],[5.3,5.8],[5.8,6.05],[6.05,6.54],[7.4,7.74],[7.74,8.05],[8.05,8.68],[8.68,9.1],[9.1,9.4],[9.4,10.11],[10.11,11.0],[11.0,11.3],[11.3,11.6],[11.6,12.0]],"female":[[0.0,0.5],[0.5,0.9],[0.9,1.5],[1.5,1.8],[1.8,2.9],[2.9,3.3],[3.3,3.59],[3.59,4.3],[4.3,5.05],[5.05,5.65],[5.65,6.25],[6.25,6.7],[6.7,7.48],[7.48,8.01],[8.01,8.4],[8.4,10.1],[10.1,11.1],[11.1,11.4],[11.4,12.2],[12.2,13.2],[13.2,13.7],[13.7,14.09],[14.09,14.6]]},"sync":[[["எரிபுனக்","burnt upland field"]],[["குறவன்","hillman"]],[["குறையல்","cut log"]],[["அன்ன","like"]],[["கரிபுற","charred back"]],[["விறகின்","of firewood"]],[["ஈம","funeral pyre"]],[["ஒள்அழல்","bright fire"]],[["குருகினும்","even than a heron"]],[["குறுகுக","let it shrink"]],[["குறுகாது","without shrinking"]],[["சென்று","having gone"]],[["விசும்பஉற","reaching the sky"]],[["நீளினும்","even if it lengthens"]],[["நீள்க","let it lengthen"]],[["பசுங்கதிர்","cool rays"]],[["திங்கள்","moon"]],[["அன்ன","like"]],[["வெண்குடை","white umbrella"]],[["ஒண்ஞாயிறு","bright sun"]],[["அன்னோன்","he who is like"]],[["புகழ்","fame"]],[["மாயலவே","will indeed not perish"]]]}